" y1=\"215.14663143989432\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"215.14663143989432\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,3\"/><polyline class=\"chart-line\" points=\"58.77747663551402,376.89719626168227 99.24696629213483,292.02247191011236 185.06240000000003,289.78666666666663 286.3542465753425,197.50684931506848 362.80779220779226,131.45454545454544 409.4029694323144,43.43231441048039\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 0%&amp;#10;It rained 1% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 214 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"58.77747663551402\" cy=\"376.89719626168227\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 12%&amp;#10;It rained 25% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 89 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"99.24696629213483\" cy=\"292.02247191011236\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 36%&amp;#10;It rained 25% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 75 days&amp;#10;within the range a perfect forecast would give\"><circle class=\"chart-dot\" cx=\"185.06240000000003\" cy=\"289.78666666666663\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 65%&amp;#10;It rained 51% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 73 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"286.3542465753425\" cy=\"197.50684931506848\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 86%&amp;#10;It rained 69% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 77 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"362.80779220779226\" cy=\"131.45454545454544\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 99%&amp;#10;It rained 93% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 229 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"409.4029694323144\" cy=\"43.43231441048039\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"235.0\" y=\"422\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">What the forecast promised</text><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"15\" y=\"200.0\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" transform=\"rotate(-90 15 200.0)\">How often it actually rained</text></svg>\n<figcaption>Green band = where a <b>flawless</b> forecast would still land, given\nhow few days we have. Red dots fall outside it, so those are real errors rather\nthan noise. The faint horizontal line is climatology\n(46%).</figcaption></figure>\n","season":"\n<h2 id=\"season\">Does the season matter?</h2>\n<p>In Tallinn the forecast is most skilful in\n<b>spring</b> (0.52) and least in\n<b>summer</b> (0.46).</p>\n<div class=\"tablewrap\">\n<table><thead><tr><th>Season</th><th class=\"num\">Days</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Rain days</th><th class=\"num\">Skill score</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Avg error</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>summer</td><td class='num'>184</td><td class='num'>53%</td><td class='num'>0.463</td><td class='num'>12.3%</td></tr><tr><td>autumn</td><td class='num'>180</td><td class='num'>53%</td><td class='num'>0.482</td><td class='num'>7.7%</td></tr><tr><td>winter</td><td class='num'>175</td><td class='num'>53%</td><td class='num'>0.509</td><td class='num'>6.8%</td></tr><tr><td>spring</td><td class='num'>218</td><td class='num'>29%</td><td class='num'>0.520</td><td class='num'>11.3%</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"muted\">Four-way splits of a two-year record are thin, so read the\nordering as indicative. Coarser binning is used here than for the annual curve\nfor the same reason.</p>\n"},"lat":59.43696,"lon":24.75353,"n":757,"n_cities":213,"name":"Tallinn","offset_days":0,"pop_map":[{"hi":0.04,"lo":0.0,"mean":0.0021962616822429905,"n":214,"obs":0.014018691588785047,"sig":true},{"hi":0.22800000000000067,"lo":0.04,"mean":0.11651685393258428,"n":89,